-- ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
-- Backfill the post-report ("afterReport") indicator data points into
-- pw_indicator_points.
--
-- Generated by scripts/esabcc-indicators/build-points-backfill.mjs from the
-- bundled src/data/*-indicators.ts series. The original seed migration
-- (041_seed_esabcc_report_indicators.sql) only went up to 2022; the monthly
-- Eurostat/EEA refresh adds later years to the TS file but the app-level
-- seeder never pushes them into an already-seeded DB. This migration closes
-- that gap.
--
-- Idempotent: on conflict (indicator_id, year) do nothing — only missing
-- years are inserted, existing rows are never overwritten. Re-run after each
-- refresh (the generator overwrites this file with the current years).
-- ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

on conflict (indicator_id, year) do nothing;
